OL,3,GNEWSAPolicy designed to 'reduce
OL,4,Aunnecessary burdens'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey's government has published its
OL,7,Ffirst overarching regulatory policy
OL,8,Faimed at reducing "unnecessary burdens"
OL,9,Fon businesses and the public.
OL,11,FIt said the framework took account of
OL,12,FJersey's needs as a small island and
OL,13,Faimed to ensure regulation was
OL,14,Fevidence-based, proportionate and
OL,15,Feffective. It has also been designed to
OL,16,Fhelp policymakers assess whether new
OL,17,Fproposals are necessary.
OL,19,FSenator Sir Mark Boleat, minister for
OL,20,Fplanning and regulation, said rules
OL,21,Fwere "essential to protecting the
OL,22,Fpublic".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
