OL,3,GNEWSAPolicy designed to 'reduce
OL,4,Aunnecessary burdens'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"By considering costs, benefits and
OL,7,Falternative approaches at an early
OL,8,Fstage, we can maintain strong
OL,9,Fprotections while avoiding unnecessary
OL,10,Fcomplexity and burden," he said.
